<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- A08 Finance & Treasury — live action children on the P03 workspace's
     generated module menus (A08 reorganization, 2026-10-24).

     The generated p03_menus.xml (cd_p03_portal) carries the registry's
     module/section structure as action-less containers; this file attaches
     ACTION-BACKED children for the real g_finance models so Odoo's native
     menu tree has ONE finance navigation scheme with clickable surfaces.
     Models resolve because cd_finance_nav depends on every owning module. -->
